---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';

const updated = 'September 12, 2026';
const email = 'zenithjoycloud@gmail.com';
---

<Base
  title="Terms of Service - ZenithJoyAI"
  description="ZenithJoyAI Terms of Service: the rules, intellectual property terms, and disclaimers that apply when using this website and its content."
>
  <section class="pt-32 pb-8 px-4">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold mb-3">Terms of Service</h1>
      <p class="text-[var(--color-text-secondary)]">Last updated: {updated}</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 pb-20 space-y-8 leading-relaxed">
    <section>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-3">1. Acceptance</h2>
      <p>By accessing or using zenithjoyai.com (the "Site"), you agree to these Terms. If you do not
      agree, please stop using the Site.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-3">2. What we provide</h2>
      <p>The Site is operated by ZenithJoyAI and provides articles, videos, and service information
      relating to AI tools, workflow automation, and content production. Content may be updated,
      changed, or removed at any time.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-3">3. Acceptable use</h2>
      <p>When using the Site, including leaving comments, you agree not to:</p>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-1 mt-2">
        <li>post content that violates applicable law;</li>
        <li>post content infringing others' intellectual property, reputation, or privacy;</li>
        <li>post spam, malicious links, or fraudulent information;</li>
        <li>scrape the Site at scale or otherwise interfere with its normal operation.</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="mt-2">We may remove content that violates these rules without prior notice.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-3">4. Intellectual property</h2>
      <p>Original articles, videos, and other materials on the Site are owned by ZenithJoyAI. You may
      read and quote them for personal study with attribution; commercial use requires written
      permission.</p>
      <p class="mt-2">You remain responsible for any comment you post and grant us permission to
      display it on the Site.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-3">5. Disclaimer</h2>
      <p>Content on the Site — including suggestions about AI tools and workflows — is
      <strong>for reference only and does not constitute professional advice</strong>. AI technology
      and third-party platform rules change quickly; evaluate suitability and compliance yourself
      before adopting any approach. We are not liable for direct or indirect losses arising from use
      of the Site's content.</p>
      <p class="mt-2">The Site is provided "as is"; we do not warrant uninterrupted or error-free service.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-3">6. Third-party services and links</h2>
      <p>The Site may link to or integrate with third-party services such as TikTok and Google. Those
      services are operated by their respective providers under their own terms, and we are not
      responsible for their content or conduct.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-3">7. Privacy</h2>
      <p>See our <a href="/en/privacy-policy" class="underline">Privacy Policy</a> for how we handle information.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-3">8. Changes</h2>
      <p>We may revise these Terms from time to time; the "Last updated" date will change. Continued
      use of the Site constitutes acceptance of the revised Terms.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-3">9. Contact</h2>
      <p>Email: <a href={`mailto:${email}`} class="underline">{email}</a></p>
    </section>
  </div>
</Base>
